{"entries":[[9006,"coach","noun",3,"/kotʃ/","m",[7542,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-coach.wav.mp3"],[["coach, trainer, instructor","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"coachs"},[],["Un énorme coach à quatre chevaux.","Conscient de ses lacunes, Gobert fait appel à un coach de neurotraining.","C'est ce qui a tout de suite plu à Thibaut Petit, l'ancien coach des féminines du BLMA (Basket Lattes Montpellier)."]],[11370,"coalition","noun",2,"/kɔ.a.li.sjɔ̃/","f",[9424,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-coalition.wav.mp3"],[["coalition","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"coalitions"},["gouvernement de coalition"],["Les ouvriers formèrent une coalition pour obtenir une augmentation de salaire.","Il y eut une coalition entre les fabricants pour s'opposer au relèvement des salaires.","Partout ce fut la débâcle pour la coalition bigarrée comme la qualifia Barthou qui resta, lui, avec les gauches."]],[14060,"coaguler","verb",2,"/kɔ.a.ɡy.le/","",[11431,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-coaguler.wav.mp3"],[["to coagulate","",["intransitive"],[],[]]],{"infinitive":"coaguler","auxiliary":"avoir","present_participle":"coagulant","past_participle":"coagulé","present":["coagule","coagules","coagule","coagulons","coagulez","coagulent"],"imperfect":["coagulais","coagulais","coagulait","coagulions","coaguliez","coagulaient"],"future":["coagulerai","coaguleras","coagulera","coagulerons","coagulerez","coaguleront"],"conditional":["coagulerais","coagulerais","coagulerait","coagulerions","coaguleriez","coaguleraient"],"subjunctive":["coagule","coagules","coagule","coagulions","coaguliez","coagulent"]},[],["Le fil est coagulé par l'alcool, l'éther, l'acide acétique, l'ammoniaque et la glycérine.","Des mains blanches voltigeaient, scintillantes, avec au bout des doigts la goutte de sang coagulé des ongles.","— Le sang défibriné est envoyé dans les cuves chauffées à la vapeur où il se coagule, l'albumine entrainant les globules."]],[23407,"coasser","verb",1,"/kɔ.a.se/","",[18876,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Penegal-coasser.wav.mp3"],[["to croak (like a frog)","",[],[],[]]],{"infinitive":"coasser","auxiliary":"avoir","present_participle":"coassant","past_participle":"coassé","present":["coasse","coasses","coasse","coassons","coassez","coassent"],"imperfect":["coassais","coassais","coassait","coassions","coassiez","coassaient"],"future":["coasserai","coasseras","coassera","coasserons","coasserez","coasseront"],"conditional":["coasserais","coasserais","coasserait","coasserions","coasseriez","coasseraient"],"subjunctive":["coasse","coasses","coasse","coassions","coassiez","coassent"]},[],["Dehors, les crapauds coassaient à un rythme régulier. »","Mais j'entends encore coasser les grenouilles du Portique. « Rien, disent les stoïciens, n'est plus déplorable que la démence. »"]],[24615,"coagulation","noun",1,"/kɔ.a.ɡy.la.sjɔ̃/","f",[19880,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-coagulation.wav.mp3"],[["coagulation","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"coagulations"},[],["Dans la pratique il est difficile de préciser les points de coagulation d'un mélange aussi complexe que la crème anglaise, par exemple."]],[25027,"coassement","noun",1,"/kɔ.as.mɑ̃/","m",[20227,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-coassement.wav.mp3"],[["croak, croaking","",[],["croassement"],[]]],{"plural":"coassements"},[],["Un double coassement venu des palmes obscures de l'île peupla lugubrement le silence de l'équipage."]],[25896,"coaliser","verb",1,"/kɔ.a.li.ze/","",[20963,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-coaliser.wav.mp3"],[["to form into a coalition, unite","",["transitive"],[],[]],["to join forces, coalize, form a coalition","",["pronominal"],[],[]]],{"infinitive":"coaliser","auxiliary":"avoir","present_participle":"coalisant","past_participle":"coalisé","present":["coalise","coalises","coalise","coalisons","coalisez","coalisent"],"imperfect":["coalisais","coalisais","coalisait","coalisions","coalisiez","coalisaient"],"future":["coaliserai","coaliseras","coalisera","coaliserons","coaliserez","coaliseront"],"conditional":["coaliserais","coaliserais","coaliserait","coaliserions","coaliseriez","coaliseraient"],"subjunctive":["coalise","coalises","coalise","coalisions","coalisiez","coalisent"]},["se coaliser"],["Coaliser des ouvriers, des nations.","Les ouvriers se coalisèrent pour exiger que le prix des journées fût augmenté.","Aujourd'hui nous voyons des puissances considérables se coaliser pour essayer de réformer l'économie capitaliste dans le sens médiéval, au moyen de lois."]],[29282,"coacher","verb",1,"/kot.ʃe/","",[23695,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-coacher.wav.mp3"],[["to coach","",[],[],[]]],{"infinitive":"coacher","auxiliary":"avoir","present_participle":"coachant","past_participle":"coaché","present":["coache","coaches","coache","coachons","coachez","coachent"],"imperfect":["coachais","coachais","coachait","coachions","coachiez","coachaient"],"future":["coacherai","coacheras","coachera","coacherons","coacherez","coacheront"],"conditional":["coacherais","coacherais","coacherait","coacherions","coacheriez","coacheraient"],"subjunctive":["coache","coaches","coache","coachions","coachiez","coachent"]},[],""],[29957,"coaltar","noun",1,"/kol.taʁ/","m",[24236,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-coaltar.wav.mp3"],[["coal tar","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"coaltars"},["être dans le coaltar"],["Rouge-coaltar, gros vin rouge.","Je sens l'odeur de la caserne. Mon nez me dénonce le mélange nauséeux de la sueur, du cuir et du coaltar.","L'atmosphère sentait la cigarette de tabac blond et la peinture fraîche, avec, de temps à autre, une bouffée de coaltar qui venait du dehors."]],[30451,"coauteur","noun",1,"/kɔ.o.tœʁ/","m",[24622,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-coauteur.wav.mp3"],[["coauthor","",[],[],[]],["cowriter","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"coauteurs","feminine":"coautrice"},[],["Elle sera accompagnée de son coauteur, l'illustrateur François Ravard."]],[31576,"coaxial","adjective",1,"/kɔ.ak.sjal/","",[25539,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-coaxial.wav.mp3"],[["coaxial","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"coaxial","feminine":"coaxiale","masculine_plura